            "detailed_description": "<h1>Note for 2020 Winter Update</h1><p>Dear Drummers,<br><br>Welcome to the 2020 winter update of Into the Rhythm VR!<br>As we mentioned, we are bringing you the new features and content.<br>Please see the changes we have made below.<br><br>1. More Speed Options.<br>As we promised, we have added 4 more speed options: x4, x6, x8, x10. With those speed options, we expect you to play difficult levels much easier since you will be able to see the gaps between notes more clearly.<br>Plus, we have implemented memory function which will keep your speed setting in a next round.<br><br>2. Fever System<br>Also, we have added the fever feature that multiplies your score depending on your accuracy. It will be activated when you fulfill the fever gauge on the right in a designated time. The bonus will be increased from x2 to x2.5 and finally x3 by consecutive fever.<br><br>3. Auto Chart (Beta)<br>Enjoy your favorite songs on Into the Rhythm VR without complicated procedures! By putting your .mp3, .wav or .ogg files in the ‘sounds’ folder, the game will make a chart by itself. We are still improving the algorithms for better accuracy, and will let you know when it works. <br><br>4. Additional Song<br>New track ‘Carol of the bells - Zero Cover’ is added. Not like previous songs, we focused more on implementing drum patterns, especially in the hard level.  Please share your opinion about it.<br><br>5. Bug fix and optimization.<br>There are many fixes in this update, but below two are the most important parts.<br>a. Key sound issue: Each note in the original tracks will make a sound correctly when you hit it. <br>b. lighting Optimization: We have removed heavy graphic effects and resources, so the workload is significantly reduced(loading time and input latency is reduced as well).<br><br>There are more things coming for you, so stay tuned.<br>Oh, and we wish you a happy X-mas and a new year.<br><br>Thank you</p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1>Into the Rhythm VR is a drumming experience brought to virtual reality. You are given drum sticks along with 6 drums. Follow the dropping notes to play the awesome music you always wanted. All you need is a place to sit, and motion controllers to strike with rhythm!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/677060/extras/e4081b37d0abb58f9b8a1ce1988f439e.poster.avif?t=1608732373\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/677060/extras/e4081b37d0abb58f9b8a1ce1988f439e.webm?t=1608732373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/677060/extras/e4081b37d0abb58f9b8a1ce1988f439e.mp4?t=1608732373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Just because they are shaped like drums, it doesn't mean you have to play drums! EDM? Heavy Metal? Play any music you like!<br></li><li>We provide with 20 original tracks<br></li><li>Variety of drum sticks and drum sets<br></li><li>Not satisfied with just 20 songs? Don't worry we provide you with the editor to create your own tracks both on your computer and VR!<br></li><li>With the tools we provide, you can insert music that you like, and make the drums play the sound that you want!<br></li><li>Once you finish creating your beautiful tracks, you can choose to share them with the world! </li></ul><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VR Editor</h2></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/677060/extras/1e3d284a333627c3dbe8c236f5c1fb41.avif?t=1608732373\" width=616 height=308 /></span><br><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >2D Editor</h2></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/677060/extras/86396a7b1f1aa6645b029a6f9a9bbfac.avif?t=1608732373\" width=616 height=308 /></span><br><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Extra Drum Sets</h2></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/677060/extras/082d29e0a8673af0f8730633beeddb78.poster.avif?t=1608732373\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/677060/extras/082d29e0a8673af0f8730633beeddb78.webm?t=1608732373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/677060/extras/082d29e0a8673af0f8730633beeddb78.mp4?t=1608732373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
            "about_the_game": "Into the Rhythm VR is a drumming experience brought to virtual reality. You are given drum sticks along with 6 drums. Follow the dropping notes to play the awesome music you always wanted. All you need is a place to sit, and motion controllers to strike with rhythm!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/677060/extras/e4081b37d0abb58f9b8a1ce1988f439e.poster.avif?t=1608732373\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/677060/extras/e4081b37d0abb58f9b8a1ce1988f439e.webm?t=1608732373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/677060/extras/e4081b37d0abb58f9b8a1ce1988f439e.mp4?t=1608732373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Just because they are shaped like drums, it doesn't mean you have to play drums! EDM? Heavy Metal? Play any music you like!<br></li><li>We provide with 20 original tracks<br></li><li>Variety of drum sticks and drum sets<br></li><li>Not satisfied with just 20 songs? Don't worry we provide you with the editor to create your own tracks both on your computer and VR!<br></li><li>With the tools we provide, you can insert music that you like, and make the drums play the sound that you want!<br></li><li>Once you finish creating your beautiful tracks, you can choose to share them with the world! </li></ul><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VR Editor</h2></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/677060/extras/1e3d284a333627c3dbe8c236f5c1fb41.avif?t=1608732373\" width=616 height=308 /></span><br><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >2D Editor</h2></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/677060/extras/86396a7b1f1aa6645b029a6f9a9bbfac.avif?t=1608732373\" width=616 height=308 /></span><br><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Extra Drum Sets</h2></strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/677060/extras/082d29e0a8673af0f8730633beeddb78.poster.avif?t=1608732373\" width=616 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/677060/extras/082d29e0a8673af0f8730633beeddb78.webm?t=1608732373\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/677060/extras/082d29e0a8673af0f8730633beeddb78.mp4?t=1608732373\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
